Z||000000||Shaun41178||04-02-99||11:06 PM||||I raced a 92 Firebird V8 Rs a while ago.  At first I didn't have my nitrous going and he was just a tad bit faster then me.  Actually about one car length to about 70 mph.  At the next light I had my nitrous activated and I wanted to race again.  The light turned green and I smoked the hell out of him.  The dude was in my rearview by the time I was through the intersection.  Man was he shocked when I slowed down to let him catch up.  He was shaking his head in digust and just looked at me all wierd.  All I could do is smile.<p>Hey if anyone else has any kill stories or been killed by another car put it up on this forum.  I am sure a lot of people would like to hear how the fiero performs against other cars.  Also list the mods done too.
